            "markers": 1,
            "text": "D1 Asakusa and Kuramae walks\nTokyo\n2\nKuramae neighborhood\n+\n−\n Leaflet | © OpenStreetMap contributors\nVisit order · Not a navigation route\nOnly places with coordinates appear on the map.\n1\nAfternoon\nSensoji Temple and Nakamise Street\nVisit Sensoji Temple in the afternoon, then stroll along Nakamise Street.\nSpecific location not confirmed\n2\nEvening\nKuramae neighborhood\nWalk through Kuramae in the evening and explore its streets of traditional craft shops and newer stores.\nNeighborhood-level location\nAdjust in planning history\nMorning and afternoon are suggested visiting periods."
